# broiler-shared-package pin 1
#
# One package of the committed, hash-pinned feed (decision SJL-D-4 (c); milestone SJL-2.7): a shared
# JavaScript library package whose home is the Broiler.JS repository, retained here byte for byte so
# that a restore needs no other repository's folder and no network for it. NuGet.config's package
# source mapping sends the Broiler.ECMAScript prefix to this directory and to nuget.org; the lock
# file of a project that references it records `content-hash`, and rule I1 holds that hash to this
# pin and to the allow-list.
#
# HOW IT WAS TAKEN. The package exactly as the Broiler.JS repository's publish-shared workflow pushed
# it to nuget.org on 2026-10-29 (run 40927396540, its artifact shared-packages, whose digest GitHub
# records as sha256:8f7b864638dd1aa5e0c199baf476aacd329436171fe3ed27335a45741701ec43 and the zip as
# downloaded on 2026-11-01 has), packed from `upstream-commit` and tagged ecmascript-v0.1.0-preview.8;
# the nuspec's repository element records the same commit, which rule I7 reads. nuget.org serves the
# same package with its repository signature (.signature.p7s) added: the package downloaded from
# nuget.org on 2026-11-01, with that entry taken out, is this file byte for byte. NuGet's content hash
# of a signed package leaves the signature out, so a restore from either source records
# `content-hash`, the base64 SHA-512 of this file's bytes. `sha256` is over the same bytes.
#
# (Added 2026-11-01, at milestone SJL-9.2c, when 0.1.0-preview.8 replaced 0.1.0-preview.7. The
# preview.7 pin's identity lines read:
#   content-hash 3ucWjca/GOOwHEiEUlJQ9a3i7Qz5NazSIq4IQF5x/WHWxueA07170X51nb06kVKcb72tziBPY1Nkz+EGv1w2cA==
#   sha256 bfd87a1857e1ab9f43d3694cf7ac2ba38b2d7a023a0392313feab2bd2d920f46
#   upstream-commit 5ddee4044c0be685e07b6da326af2e22acbb912e)
#
# WHAT IT IS. The time data home's generator (milestone SJL-8.2; Broiler.VM's JSD-0076), namespace
# Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation.Time, unchanged since 0.1.0-preview.5, and since this version the
# Intl data home's generator (milestone SJL-9.2b; Broiler.VM's JSD-0082, decisions D10 to D12),
# namespace Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation.Intl: the CLDR and UCD pin readers, the reader of the UCD
# subset the collation tables need, and the generator of the Intl and collation tables, ported from
# this repository's architecture tests. Between Broiler.JS 5ddee404, which published 0.1.0-preview.7,
# and `upstream-commit`, the files under Broiler.ECMAScript/Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation that change
# are the Intl/ directory's (all new), PublicAPI.txt's Intl lines and the project file's comment and
# description; no file of Time/ changes. Those files are the ones Broiler.JS ff54e1d8 merged
# (Broiler-Platform/Broiler.JS#1080): no file under Broiler.ECMAScript/Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation
# changes between ff54e1d8 and `upstream-commit`. Admitted TEST-ONLY for
# Broiler.VM.Architecture.Tests: rules N29 to N32 regenerate the time zone and calendar tables with
# it, rule N28 the Intl tables and rule N27 reads the CLDR pin with it, and rule I4 holds the data
# versions it declares to this repository's pins (decision SJL-D-6 (c): "the generator reaches each
# engine's tests as a pinned, test-only package, and never a product closure"). No release may ship
# it (eng/verify-feed.ps1). It carries no table and no pin file, and it has no dependency. It is on
# nuget.org since 2026-10-29.

id Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation
version 0.1.0-preview.8
file Broiler.ECMAScript.Generation.0.1.0-preview.8.nupkg
content-hash C1rgQojk5eDD0obxYtAq/CbhlCDmwnwyc5QOhWZEKynXKqjJFqrSwm+OHB239hEu3GV3ICeLgL+ugL4ZbTIYTA==
sha256 fe06bacc761bb774548b24b1bacc3114cce6755a2101c59a360a1b880757ba43
upstream Broiler-Platform/broiler.js
upstream-commit 3b4b6860d66a82a5dd6e6538f60b2bc4b1632fd6
